:: Underground Brothel Contract Departure
/* Still in whichever office made the offer, right up until the car pulls away. */
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to $undergroundbrothelcontract.broker is "Bailey" ? "home" : "brothel">><<effects>>
<<pass 30>><<endevent>>
/* The broker has to be re-established here */
<<if $undergroundbrothelcontract.broker is "Bailey">>
	<<npc Bailey>><<person1>>
	Bailey makes the call before you can change your mind. A car with blacked-out windows is waiting behind the orphanage. <<He>> watches while two people search you.
	<br><br>
	"Don't come crying to me if you hate it," Bailey says. One of the people waiting beside the car takes your contract from <<him>>.
<<else>>
	<<npc Briar>><<person1>>
	Briar makes a short call. Half an hour later, two people lead you through a rear door to a car with blacked-out windows. They search you while Briar watches from the doorway.
	<br><br>
	"Our part's finished," <<he>> says. "Whatever happens down there is between you and them." One of the people waiting beside the car takes your contract from <<him>>.
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<link [[Meet your handler|Underground Brothel Contract Master Introduction]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>

:: Underground Brothel Contract Master Introduction
/* Behind the office, then inside the car; out of the building but not yet underground. */
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>>
<<undergroundBrothelContractMaster>>
The <<person>> holding your contract steps close and looks you over without speaking. <<He>> catches your chin and forces you to meet <<his>> eyes.
<br><br>
"The brothel bought your time. Until the date on this paper, you answer to me." <<He>> folds the contract and slips it beneath one arm.
"You call me <<= _contractMasterTitleCap>>. Understood?"
<br><br>
<<link [[Nod|Underground Brothel Contract Transport]]>><<set $undergroundbrothelcontract.obedience to Math.min(5, $undergroundbrothelcontract.obedience + 1)>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[Stay quiet|Underground Brothel Contract Introduction Quiet]]>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[Remind <<him>> this is only a contract|Underground Brothel Contract Transport]]>><<set $undergroundbrothelcontract.obedience to Math.max(-3, $undergroundbrothelcontract.obedience - 1)>><<stress 4>><</link>><<gstress>>
<br>

:: Underground Brothel Contract Introduction Quiet
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>>
<<undergroundBrothelContractMaster>>
<<if $submissive lte 850>>
	You say nothing, but keep your eyes fixed on <<his>>.
<<elseif $submissive gte 1150>>
	You lower your eyes and stay quiet.
<<else>>
	You say nothing.
<</if>>
<br><br>
"At least you know when to keep your mouth shut," your <<= _contractMasterTitle>> says. <<He>> opens the rear door of the car.
<br><br>
<<link [[Get in|Underground Brothel Contract Transport]]>><</link>>
<br>

:: Underground Brothel Contract Transport
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>>
<<undergroundBrothelContractMaster>>
Before you can sit, your <<= _contractMasterTitle>> pulls a hood over your head.
<<if $rightarm isnot "bound" or $leftarm isnot "bound">>
	<<He>> binds your arms behind your back and checks the knots twice.<<bind>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
The door closes. The car moves before you can judge which direction it faces.
Your <<= _contractMasterTitle>> sits beside you, one hand resting on your leash. The hood smells of detergent and someone else's sweat.
<br><br>
<<socialiseicon "ask">><<link [[Ask where you're being taken|Underground Brothel Contract Transport Question]]>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[Stay quiet|Underground Brothel Contract Transport Quiet]]>><</link>>
<br>
<<refuseicon>><<link [[Pull against the bindings|Underground Brothel Contract Transport Resist]]>><<def 1>><</link>><<defianttext>>
<br>

:: Underground Brothel Contract Transport Question
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>>
<<undergroundBrothelContractMaster>>
"Where are you taking me?" you ask.
<br><br>
<<switch _contractMasterTrait>>
	<<case "relaxed">>
		"Where you agreed to go," your <<= _contractMasterTitle>> replies. "Save your worry for when the hood comes off."
	<<case "sociable">>
		"Back underground," your <<= _contractMasterTitle>> says. "Private room, house stage, as many shifts as they can fit before your release date. You did read the paper."
	<<case "brooding">>
		"The brothel," your <<= _contractMasterTitle>> says. Nothing more follows.
	<<case "lecher">>
		"Somewhere no one will interrupt us," your <<= _contractMasterTitle>> says. <<His>> hand slides down the leash until <<his>> knuckles touch your collar. "Unless they've paid for the privilege."
<</switch>>
<br><br>
The car turns sharply. With no view outside, the answer tells you nothing about the route.
<br><br>
<<link [[Fall silent|Underground Brothel Contract Transport Journey]]>><</link>>
<br>

:: Underground Brothel Contract Transport Quiet
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>>
<<undergroundBrothelContractMaster>>
You keep your questions to yourself and listen. Traffic thins, returns, then disappears beneath the steady hum of an enclosed road.
<br><br>
<<switch _contractMasterTrait>>
	<<case "relaxed">>
		Your <<= _contractMasterTitle>> settles deeper into the seat, keeping only enough tension on the leash to remind you it is there.
	<<case "sociable">>
		"Good," your <<= _contractMasterTitle>> says. "You can listen. That will make the first few days easier."
	<<case "brooding">>
		Your <<= _contractMasterTitle>> says nothing. Whenever the car turns, <<his>> grip stops you from sliding across the seat.
	<<case "lecher">>
		Your <<= _contractMasterTitle>> toys with the leash in the silence, drawing you close and letting it slacken again.
<</switch>>
<br><br>
<<link [[Keep waiting|Underground Brothel Contract Transport Journey]]>><</link>>
<br>

:: Underground Brothel Contract Transport Resist
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>>
<<undergroundBrothelContractMaster>>
You twist your wrists and pull against the knots. Your <<= _contractMasterTitle>> catches the movement at once and jerks the leash short, dragging you against <<him>>.
<br><br>
<<switch _contractMasterTrait>>
	<<case "relaxed">>
		"Bit late for that." <<He>> tightens the knot with an irritated tug. "You signed before I tied it."
	<<case "sociable">>
		"Already putting on a show?" <<he>> asks. "Keep it up. The house will know exactly how to introduce you."
	<<case "brooding">>
		<<He>> says nothing. The knot is simply pulled tighter until your hands begin to ache.
	<<case "lecher">>
		"That's better," <<he>> murmurs, forcing your bound hands still. "I was worried the contract had made you boring."
<</switch>>
<<pain 3>><<stress 4>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
<<set $undergroundbrothelcontract.obedience to Math.max(-3, $undergroundbrothelcontract.obedience - 1)>>
<br><br>
<<link [[Stop struggling|Underground Brothel Contract Transport Journey]]>><</link>>
<br>

:: Underground Brothel Contract Transport Journey
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>>
<<undergroundBrothelContractMaster>>
The journey stretches on. You count turns until you lose track. At some point the road changes beneath the tyres, smooth tarmac giving way to concrete. The car slows, descends, and passes through a gate that closes heavily behind it.
<br><br>
Your <<= _contractMasterTitle>> keeps hold of the leash until the engine stops.
<br><br>
<<link [[Wait for the hood to come off (0:30)|Underground Brothel Contract Arrival]]>><<pass 30>><</link>>
<br>

:: Underground Brothel Contract Arrival
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "underground">><<effects>>
<<undergroundBrothelContractMaster>>
The hood comes off when the car stops. You're already below ground. Music echoes faintly through the walls.
<br><br>
Your <<= _contractMasterTitle>> checks the contract against your face. "Voluntary booking," <<he>> says. "That buys you a release date. Nothing else."
<br><br>
Your clothes are taken, labelled, and sealed in a plastic crate. Metal closes around your neck and ankles. You knew what you were agreeing to.
<<undress "underground_contract">>
<<if $worn.neck.name is "familiar collar" and $worn.neck.cursed is 1>>
	Your <<= _contractMasterTitle>> fails to remove your collar and gives up with a curse.
<<else>>
	<<neckwear 21>>
<</if>>
<<if !$worn.feet.type.includes("shackle")>><<shackle_feet>><</if>>
<br><br>
<<link [[Let <<him>> inspect you|Underground Brothel Contract Rules]]>><</link>>
<br>

:: Underground Brothel Contract Rules
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "underground">><<effects>>
<<undergroundBrothelContractMaster>>
The senior handler assigned to you circles slowly, recording marks, piercings, and signs of pregnancy.
<<He>> checks your mouth with a gloved thumb and gives the leash a testing pull.
<br><br>
"You work when the light above your door turns pink. Patrons choose what they want. We don't promise condoms.
We don't promise they'll be careful." <<He>> points along the corridor. "The tap works. The mattress is yours.
Behave and you can use the washroom between shifts."
<br><br>
"Refuse, fight, or touch the outer doors and a day gets added. No pay for penalty time.
Labour gets you a hospital bed, not freedom. We collect you after."
<br><br>
"While you're here, you call me <<= _contractMasterTitleCap>>. I decide whether you've behaved."
<br><br>
<<link [[Say you understand|Underground Brothel Contract Room]]>><<set $undergroundbrothelcontract.obedience to Math.min(5, $undergroundbrothelcontract.obedience + 1)>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[Say nothing|Underground Brothel Contract Room]]>><</link>>
<br>

:: Underground Brothel Contract Room
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "underground">><<effects>>
<<undergroundBrothelContractMaster>>
Your <<= _contractMasterTitle>> leads you past the black cells. Your room is different only in small ways:
a thin mattress raised from the floor, a metal toilet, a tap, and a numbered light above the door.
<br><br>
There is no handle on your side. <<He>> clips the contract schedule behind a clear panel, pushes you inside, and locks the door.
<br><br>
The pink light blinks once. Your first shift will begin soon.
<br><br>
<<set $undergroundbrothel to {
	"active": true,
	"time": 0,
	"timepass": false,
	"water": 0,
	"escape": $undergroundbrothel?.escape ?? 0
}>>
<<badEndTracking "Underground Dungeon" { reason: "uDungeonContract" }>>
<<link [[Wait|Underground Brothel Contract Quarters]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>

:: Underground Brothel Contract Main Room
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "underground">><<effects>>
<<if Time.days gte $undergroundbrothelcontract.end>>
	<<include "Underground Brothel Contract Complete">>
<<elseif isPregnancyEnding()>>
	<<pregnancyPassout "dungeon">>
<<else>>

<<undergroundBrothelContractMaster>>
The contracted workers' common room lies between the sleeping corridor and the performance halls.
Worn couches surround a low table. A sink and food hatch occupy one wall. Opposite them,
stairs climb towards the locked outer door.
<br><br>
<<if Time.hour gte 22 or Time.hour lt 6>>
	Your <<= _contractMasterTitle>> is in the staff quarters. A night handler watches the room from behind the desk.
<<elseif Time.hour lt 10>>
	Your <<= _contractMasterTitle>> stands behind the desk, reading the previous night's reports and checking names against the morning schedule.
<<elseif Time.hour lt 18>>
	Your <<= _contractMasterTitle>> moves between the desk and performance hall, stopping occasionally to speak with staff.
<<else>>
	<<switch _contractMasterTrait>>
		<<case "relaxed">>
			Your <<= _contractMasterTitle>> sits on a couch with the evening schedule resting across <<his>> knee, appearing almost half asleep.
		<<case "sociable">>
			Your <<= _contractMasterTitle>> leans against the desk, chatting with patrons and describing the workers available tonight.
		<<case "brooding">>
			Your <<= _contractMasterTitle>> stands beside a dark window overlooking the stage, watching without joining the conversation around <<him>>.
		<<case "lecher">>
			Your <<= _contractMasterTitle>> watches the performance feed from a couch, one hand resting between <<his>> legs.
	<</switch>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<if $undergroundbrothelcontract.obedience lt 2 and Time.hour gte 6 and Time.hour lt 22>>
	Your <<= _contractMasterTitle>> looks up and immediately reaches for a length of restraint. "Who gave you permission to leave your room?"
	<br><br>
	<<link [[Submit|Underground Brothel Contract Punishment Submit]]>><<set $sexstart to 1>><<undergroundBrothelContractPenalty>><<sub 3>><</link>> <span class="red">(adds one unpaid day)</span><<submissivetext>>
	<br>
	<<link [[Resist|Underground Brothel Contract Punishment Fight]]>><<set $molestationstart to 1>><<undergroundBrothelContractPenalty>><</link>> <span class="red">(adds one unpaid day)</span>
<<else>>
	<<undergroundBrothelContractMasterOpinion>>
	<br><br>
	<<if _contractMasterTrait is "lecher" and Time.hour gte 18 and Time.hour lt 22>>
		Your <<= _contractMasterTitle>> notices you looking. <<He>> pats the empty space beside <<him>>.
		<br>
		<<brothelicon>><<link [[Go to <<him>>|Underground Brothel Contract Master Personal]]>><</link>>
		<br><br>
	<</if>>
	<<couchicon>><<link [[Rest on a couch (1:00)|Underground Brothel Contract Main Room]]>><<pass 1 hour>><<set $tiredness -= 1200>><<stress -4>><</link>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br>
	<<foodicon>><<link [[Eat and drink (0:30)|Underground Brothel Contract Main Room]]>><<pass 30>><<stress -4>><<trauma -2>><</link>><<lstress>><<ltrauma>>
	<br>
	<<socialiseicon "ask">><<link [[Approach your <<= _contractMasterTitle>>|Underground Brothel Contract Master Inspection]]>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<if $undergroundbrothelcontract.obedience gte 3>>
		<<dooricon>><<link [[Enter your <<= _contractMasterTitle>>'s bedroom|Underground Brothel Contract Master Bedroom]]>><</link>>
		<br>
	<</if>>
	<<brothelicon>><<link [[Report for work (1:00)|Underground Brothel Contract Work]]>><<pass 1 hour>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<exiticon>><<link [[Return to your room|Underground Brothel Contract Quarters]]>><</link>>
	<br><br>
	The outer door is visible at the top of the stairs.
	<br>
	<<if $leftarm is "bound" and $rightarm is "bound">>
		<span class="blue">You cannot work its lock while your arms are bound.</span>
	<<else>>
		<<lockicon "pick">><<link [[Try the outer door (0:05)|Underground Brothel Contract Exit Sneak]]>><<set $skulduggerydifficulty to 1000>><<pass 5>><</link>><<skulduggerydifficulty>>
	<</if>>
<</if>>
<</if>>
<br>

:: Underground Brothel Contract Master Personal
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "underground">><<effects>>
<<undergroundBrothelContractMaster>>
Your <<= _contractMasterTitle>> grabs your leash and draws you between <<his>> knees. "The patrons don't get all of your contracted time," <<he>> says.
<br><br>
<<He>> pulls you down onto the couch. The other workers and handlers continue moving through the room without looking your way.
<br><br>
/* Not "Underground Cell Molestation": its aftermath narrates a patron shouting to be let out of your locked cell and then generates a replacement NPC, which contradicts this scene and discards the handler. */
<<link [[Let it happen|Underground Brothel Contract Sleep Molestation]]>><<set $molestationstart to 1>><<set $phase to 0>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[Struggle|Underground Brothel Contract Sleep Molestation]]>><<set $molestationstart to 1>><<set $phase to 1>><</link>>
<br>

:: Underground Brothel Contract Master Bedroom
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "underground">><<effects>>
<<if Time.days gte $undergroundbrothelcontract.end>>
	<<include "Underground Brothel Contract Complete">>
<<elseif isPregnancyEnding()>>
	<<pregnancyPassout "dungeon">>
<<else>>
	<<undergroundBrothelContractMaster>>
	The private bedroom used by your <<= _contractMasterTitle>> is warmer than the workers' quarters. A wide bed fills most of the room. A wardrobe stands beside a desk covered with contracts, keys, and performance schedules.
	<br><br>
	<<if Time.hour gte 22 or Time.hour lt 6>>
		Your <<= _contractMasterTitle>> is here, preparing to sleep.
	<<elseif Time.hour lt 10>>
		Your <<= _contractMasterTitle>> is finishing <<his>> morning paperwork at the desk.
	<<else>>
		The room is empty while your <<= _contractMasterTitle>> works elsewhere in the brothel.
	<</if>>
	<br><br>
	<<undergroundBrothelContractMasterOpinion>>
	<br><br>
	The bed looks far more comfortable than your mattress.
	<br>
	<<if $undergroundbrothelcontract.obedience gte 4>>
		Your <<= _contractMasterTitle>> permits you to sleep there, though a short chain beside the pillow remains ready for your collar.
		<br>
		<<bedicon "deluxe">><<link [[Lie on the bed|Underground Brothel Contract Master Bed]]>><</link>>
	<<else>>
		<span class="red">Your <<= _contractMasterTitle>> has not given you permission to use it, and will block the door if you try.</span>
		<br>
		<<bedicon "deluxe">><<link [[Try for the bed anyway|Underground Brothel Contract Master Bed]]>><</link>> <span class="red">(<<he>> will turn you away)</span>
	<</if>>
	<br><br>
	The wardrobe contains spare sheets, restraints, and clothes reserved for performances. Your original outfit remains sealed with the contract office.
	<br>
	<<wardrobeicon>><<link [[Examine the wardrobe|Underground Brothel Contract Bedroom Wardrobe]]>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<exiticon>><<link [[Return to the common room|Underground Brothel Contract Main Room]]>><</link>>
<</if>>
<br>

:: Underground Brothel Contract Bedroom Wardrobe
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "underground">><<effects>>
<<undergroundBrothelContractMaster>>
<<outfitChecks>>
<<if $undergroundbrothelcontract.obedience gte 4>>
	Your <<= _contractMasterTitle>> has left one section unlocked for you. It contains clean towels, a folded blanket, and several humiliating performance outfits. None are suitable for leaving the brothel.
	<br><br>
	<<if _shirtless and $underground_shirt isnot 1>>
		A shirt with the word "Slut" printed across its chest lies on top.
		<br>
		<<wardrobeicon>><<link [[Wear the shirt|Underground Brothel Contract Master Bedroom]]>><<upperwear "slut shirt">><<set $underground_shirt to 1>><</link>>
		<br>
	<</if>>
	<<link [[Close the wardrobe|Underground Brothel Contract Master Bedroom]]>><</link>>
<<else>>
	The wardrobe is locked. Your <<= _contractMasterTitle>> notices you testing the handle.
	"Your clothes stay sealed until release," <<he>> says.
	<br><br>
	<<link [[Step away|Underground Brothel Contract Master Bedroom]]>><</link>>
<</if>>
<br>

:: Underground Brothel Contract Floor Rest
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "underground">><<effects>>
<<undergroundBrothelContractMaster>>
<<if Time.days gte $undergroundbrothelcontract.end>>
	<<include "Underground Brothel Contract Complete">>
<<elseif isPregnancyEnding()>>
	<<pregnancyPassout "dungeon">>
<<elseif Time.hour gte 6 and Time.hour lt 22 and $undergroundbrothelcontract.obedience lt 0 and random(1, 3) is 1>>
	The lock opens before you can get comfortable. Your <<= _contractMasterTitle>> enters carrying a restraint.
	"You don't get to hide on the floor after the trouble you've caused."
	<br><br>
	<<link [[Submit|Underground Brothel Contract Punishment Submit]]>><<set $sexstart to 1>><<sub 3>><</link>><<submissivetext>>
	<br>
	<<link [[Fight back|Underground Brothel Contract Punishment Fight]]>><<set $molestationstart to 1>><</link>>
<<elseif Time.hour gte 18 and Time.hour lt 22 and _contractMasterTrait is "lecher" and random(1, 3) is 1>>
	You wake when your <<= _contractMasterTitle>> rolls you onto your back with <<his>> foot.
	"Rest later," <<he>> says, winding your leash around <<his>> hand.
	<br><br>
	<<link [[Let <<him>> continue|Underground Brothel Contract Sleep Molestation]]>><<set $molestationstart to 1>><<set $phase to 0>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[Struggle|Underground Brothel Contract Sleep Molestation]]>><<set $molestationstart to 1>><<set $phase to 1>><</link>>
<<else>>
	The floor is cold, but the wall supports your back. You manage to rest until footsteps or distant music wake you.<<stress -4>><<trauma -4>><<lstress>><<ltrauma>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[Get up|Underground Brothel Contract Quarters]]>><</link>>
<</if>>
<br>
